  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Early Recovery for Lasting Resilience in Gaza</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="DE">&#xdc;bergangshilfe zu dauerhafter Resilienz in Gaza</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The target group are households affected by the conflict. primarily women, young people and children, directly benefiting approximately 29,750 persons, indirectly benefiting approximately 57,500 persons, a total of approximately 87,200 persons. The resilience of the beneficiaries is to be strengthened through the establishment of savings and credit communities as well as age-appropriate psychosocial support for children / advice from their parents (positive methods of education and stress management).</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="DE">Zielgruppe sind vom Konflikt betroffene Haushalte.prim&#xe4;r Frauen, Jugendliche und Kinder, direkt beg&#xfc;nstigt circa 29.750 Personen, indirekt beg&#xfc;nstigt circa 57.500 Personen, insgesamt rund 87.200 Personen. Die Resilienz der Beg&#xfc;nstigten soll gest&#xe4;rkt werden durch die Einrichtung von Spar- und Kreditgemeinschaften sowie altersgerechte psychosoziale Unterst&#xfc;tzung von Kindern / Beratung von deren Eltern (positive Methoden der Erziehung und Stressbew&#xe4;ltigung).</narrative>
  </description>
